==English==

===Etymology===
< {{etyl|la}} {{term|potens||powerful, strong, potent}}, present participle of {{term|posse||to be able}} < {{term|potis||able, powerful, originally a lord, master}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈpəʊtənt/}}
* {{rhymes|əʊtənt}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Possessing [[strength]]
# Being [[effective]] in small [[quantity|quantities]].
# Having a [[sharp]] or [[offensive]] taste.
# {{context|of a male}} able to [[procreate]].
# [[very]] [[powerful]] or [[effective]].

